sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Researcher
    participant API as FastAPI Gateway
    participant Orch as Workflow Orchestrator
    participant Plan as Planner Agent
    participant GEE as Earth Engine Agent
    participant Ver as Verification Agent
    participant Rep as Report Agent

    User->>API: Submit Research Question (e.g. UHI in Paris)
    API->>Orch: Initialize Research Project & Workflow
    Orch->>Plan: Generate Execution Plan
    Plan-->>Orch: Structured Plan Schema
    Orch-->>User: Plan Awaiting Human Approval
    User->>API: Approve Workflow Plan
    API->>Orch: Trigger Asynchronous Pipeline
    Orch->>GEE: Execute Earth Engine Job (Landsat/Sentinel)
    GEE-->>Orch: Export GeoTIFF & Zonal Stats
    Orch->>Ver: Validate Claims against Evidence
    Ver-->>Orch: Claim Verification Status (VERIFIED/PARTIAL)
    Orch->>Rep: Assemble Publication Report
    Rep-->>Orch: Final Markdown Report
    Orch-->>User: Deliver Verifiable Scientific Report
